        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul Cook, Matthew Ashman\n- Organizations: Sex Pistols, Chiefs of Relief\n- Places: Hammersmith, London\n- Roles: drummer, vocalist\n- Topics: punk rock, electro-punk\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Thomas Cook was born on 20 July 1956 in Hammersmith, London.\n- The Sex Pistols were an English punk rock band formed in London in 1975.\n- Paul Cook is an English drummer and a member of the Sex Pistols.\n- Chiefs of Relief were a British rock group with a unique electro-punk style.\n- Matthew Ashman was the guitarist and vocalist of Chiefs of Relief.\n- Paul Cook was also a drummer in Chiefs of Relief.",
